      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create the specified Python files with the required AWS integration for streaming speech-to-text. Each scored implementation file must use AWS and make that provider identifiable in the code. The local helper files will contain configuration and utility functions to support the scored files. </thinking>\n\n",
